WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.970
<i>"Inherit."</i>

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>If I were to give the term another name,</i>

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>it would be "curse."</i>

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.410
<i>I inherited the Buranki heart 
passed down throughout my family.</i>

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:19.740
<i>Then I had a child, the one and only 
way to be freed from that curse.</i>

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.620
<i>Then, one day,</i>

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.440
<i>I suddenly lost my son.</i>

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:32.920
<i>And then that cursed power 
returned to me once more.</i>

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.140
<i>I made up my mind</i>

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.940
<i>that I would rid the world of these</i>

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.660
<i>Buranki that had tainted human blood 
and placed this loathsome curse on us,</i>

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:47.900
<i>and bring this world back into the 
hands of pure, untainted humans.</i>

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:58.020
<b>Episode 22
The Comet
 Opens Its Eyes</b>

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:58.030
<b><i>BUBUKI BURANKI
The Gentle Giants
 of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.170
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.170
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:28.190
BURANKI

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.860
BURANKI

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:35.650
BURANKI

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:55.550
Kazuki

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:55.550
Kaoruko

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.450
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.450
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.000
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.000
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.370
Damn it!

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.980
What's going on?

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.450
Where's Migiwa-san?

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.670
What happened to Migiwa-san?!

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:15.040
What is that?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.990
Is that what was inside Treasure Island?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:41.400
Is this the "Great One of the beginning" 
that Duroc-san talked about?

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:45.760
Treasure Island itself was Deus Magna?

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:51.870
That is the Buranki that 
Guy spoke of, Deus Magna.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.000
Just how stupidly huge is that thing?!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.210
Reoko?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.860
Hang in there, Kaoruko!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.320
Reoko-sama!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.110
Who's piloting Entei?!

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:07.890
That's...

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.100
The false heart used for 
remotely controlling Buranki!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.040
Reoko!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.130
Reoko!

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.240
Reoko-sama!

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.750
Is that...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.080
Entei?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.020
Why is Reoko here?

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.660
The comet

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.640
was Deus Magna's head?

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:39.730
What is Guy trying to 
accomplish with this thing?

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:45.650
So Entei has fulfilled 
its original purpose...

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:51.470
Now, the first day in this newly 
created world will begin!

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:08.020
That thing's way too huge...

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.340
Bubuki won't be any use against that.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.800
Unless they become a Buranki.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.650
No! No! No! No! No!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.140
Honestly... I can't believe my eyes.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.400
Justin!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.570
Hm? Oh, it's you guys.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.910
So you came back to me after all, eh?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:28.280
Well, come on! We're bringing out Batolov!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.260
What?!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.760
As if we'd go anywhere with you!

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:31.700
No thanks!

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.210
Why?

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.450
You can't fight that Buranki 
without Batolov, right?

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:40.310
We'll never listen to 
anything you say again!

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:43.710
That's right! If you want to fight 
with us, then apologize to us!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.380
Apologize? Me? For what?

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.460
Why should I?

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:51.180
That's rich, after you 
treated us so terribly!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.110
Wh-What are you doing?

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.250
Shut up and apologize right now!

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.210
But why do I have to—

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:13.530
Because it's a ritual, that's why.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:19.810
A ritual you perform for us limbs if you 
want to be this team's heart again.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:20.740
Hmm...

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.390
Well, if I, as the future king,

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:29.640
can't take part in this battle that may 
decide the fate of humanity, there's no point.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:32.280
I still don't quite get it, but...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.080
Is this good enough?

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.890
You don't look sorry at all!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.360
Bow your head lower!

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:39.350
And say, "I'm sorry," out loud!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.160
That's a lot of steps.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.400
Just do it!

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.150
I'm sorry.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.700
Is this good enough?

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.790
Hey. How long do I have to stay like this?

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:38.740
Oubu?

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.950
Why is Oubu here?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.120
Kazuki Migiwa.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.370
I have been waiting for you.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.960
Oubu! How are you able to speak?

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.130
Wait, Azuma... Did you...

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:57.590
There is no human within me.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.310
What's going on?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.870
I was trying to destroy Treasure Island.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.570
And what is this place?

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:13.250
What happened to me?

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.350
Did I... die?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.850
Oubu, please answer me.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.880
You know something, don't you?

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:37.380
Kazuki Migiwa...

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.550
Our child.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.520
<b><i>BUBUKI BURANKI</i></b>

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.520
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.280
You intend to become my brain?

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:56.330
Be grateful.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:10:00.450
This will allow you to live longer.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:07.820
And you do understand what will 
come of that, do you not?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.040
Of course I do.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.840
The military's attacks 
aren't hurting it at all,

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.610
but it's still not even moving.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:23.900
Yeah... And earlier,

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.630
we saw Entei fly toward it.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:31.150
But there was a huge explosion 
right after that.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.480
That must have killed Reoko...

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.500
It's all right.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.570
I can sense Entei within that person.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.460
Are you sure, Shizuru?

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.490
Nod.

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:43.810
Shizuru-chan, what do you 
mean by "that person"?

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.330
I felt it on Treasure Island, too.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.680
That person is very, very kind.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.290
Even now,

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:57.880
it feels sad that so many 
living things surrounding it died.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:04.560
If that's true, then I want to 
protect Deus Magna from Guy.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:09.100
That thing really is astonishingly huge.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.360
Is that Duroc?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.990
What is Duroc-san doing here?

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:24.740
Justin...

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:30.080
I believe I ordered you to eliminate
the Buranki Oubu and its heart user.

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:35.250
Surely you don't intend to 
defy me, as well, do you?

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.340
Guy!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.840
Guy?!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.560
You're Guy?

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:45.010
<i>I suppose this is our second 
meeting, Kazuki Azuma-kun.</i>

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.850
No, witch's son.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:52.480
To ensure that no more pitiful,

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.610
ugly children like all of you are born,

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.990
I will rebuild this world with my own hands.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.110
We won't...

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.500
...let you do that!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.780
Iwatooshi!

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:19.880
This Buranki cannot assimilate me.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:24.050
I have just taken total control over it!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.180
Duroc-san...

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:30.450
The heart user alone rules the Buranki

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.980
and becomes its brain without 
being assimilated...

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.230
All the sacrifices I've made 
have been for that purpose!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:41.990
Through the noble sacrifices 
of those young Bubuki users,

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:47.990
I have completed the final adjustments on 
this heart designed to control Buranki!

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.870
And now I will make their god,

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:57.210
this giant towering above the stars,
into my slave!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.340
What?!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:36.510
The inside of this Buranki's head 
is hollow, just like the others.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:40.380
Which means their god is already dead.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.500
A-chan! A-chan!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.070
Azuma! Get a grip!

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:54.640
Guy said just now that he was 
going to rebuild the world.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.760
What did he mean?

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:58.650
What the...

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.970
That's some serious destructive force!

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.540
This is gonna wipe out the whole world!

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:24.200
I simply grasp a part of this thing, 
and it produces this much force?

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.170
Absolutely incredible.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.180
Ugly beasts known as Buranki,
be reduced to atoms!

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.230
Before I can control this thing as I desire,

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:42.480
it appears I must wait a while, until Duroc 
adapts to functioning as its cerebral nerves.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:46.550
<i>Azuma-kun!</i>

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:52.620
<i>I've finished analyzing the data that 
Zetsubi-san brought from the Demokratia HQ.</i>

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:57.880
Guy's organization spent many 
years researching Buranki.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:00.250
They finally deduced that

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:04.820
Reoko-sama's Entei would connect 
the airborne head of Deus Magna

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:07.970
to its body, which existed here 
in the form of Treasure Island.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.760
It's basically a plug.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.510
So that's why Guy was so 
fixated on Reoko-sama?

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:14.600
Yes.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:17.430
Entei's unique regenerative ability

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:22.260
is the keystone that enables the fusion 
between Deus Magna's body and head.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.520
So if you take Entei away from that thing,

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.820
it won't be able to maintain its massive form,
and it'll self-destruct.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:34.580
Azuma, sorry to keep asking 
favors of you, but...

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.160
You want me to save Reoko.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.410
That's it, right, Matobai-san?

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.570
Yeah, that's right.

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:47.000
Sorry to keep forcing all 
the big jobs on you,

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.630
but I'm counting on you, Azuma.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.370
Got it. We'll find Entei

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:54.450
and get Reoko out of Deus Magna,
 whatever it takes!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.690
Justin, help us out.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:02.130
We could use your help to find Entei

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:04.480
and get Reoko out of that thing.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.900
Kazuki Azuma...

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.780
Why must I do as you say?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.000
I see I have no choice.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:27.200
To protect the entire planet 
is my duty as the future king!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:32.610
I will show you the insurmountable force 
of the Buranki Batolov in battle!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.620
Here we go again.

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:36.060
That's Justin for you.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:40.480
If he overdoes it, we can just slug 
him and teach him a lesson again.

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.060
His sides are his weakness.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.020
Sh-Shut up, all of you!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.930
Kazuki Azuma!

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:50.600
You've just incurred a massive debt to me!

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.570
Don't you dare forget that!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.740
<i>Hear me?! You got that?!</i>

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.820
Yeah, I got it.

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.490
Behold! This is the Buranki Batolov!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:05.730
This is the power of Justin Lion, 
the future king of this world!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.500
Nice one, Justin!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:21.000
You've got guts, that's for sure!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.100
Over here, Kaoruko!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:31.230
If we wanna beat that giant thing, 
we need every Buranki we can get!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:34.260
Help us out, Kaoruko!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.020
You fools who would defy God...

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:45.750
It's time you learned your place!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.400
<i>Why?</i>

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.730
<i>Why don't you understand, Migiwa?</i>

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:17.130
<i>Those irresponsible humans did nothing 
but force Oubu and Entei upon us!</i>

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:22.490
<i>What good would it be to do as they 
say and protect Oubu and Entei?!</i>

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.920
<i>That's why I'm going to use Entei</i>

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:29.090
<i>and its power to protect this 
land from foolish humans!</i>

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:34.250
<i>Using the power of the one and only 
Buranki you left here on Earth!</i>

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:36.890
Migiwa...

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:47.000
So that's Deus Magna,
the thing Guy resurrected...

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.540
That's a Buranki?

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.230
It's even taller than this mountain!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.690
Even Mega-lala is no match for that thing.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.010
Do you still have the will to fight,

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:06.550
user of the Buranki Mega-lala's heart?

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.500
Listen to me, user of Mega-lala's heart!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:17.260
Laetitia-sama piloted the Buranki 
with a wish for world peace.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:20.190
She wanted Entei's regenerative ability

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:24.200
so she could continue to protect 
her homeland and this world.

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:27.710
But Guy used her intentions 
for his own purposes,

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:32.270
and used her very life to 
serve his own ambitions.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.450
She truly died in vain!

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:38.690
What did you say?! I won't let you say that!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.360
I won't ever allow it!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:41.610
You bastard!

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.490
I guess you do have some 
fighting spirit left.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.960
What? You wanna fight?!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.850
To seek compensation for 
Laetitia-sama's death,

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:56.960
you will fight in our stead.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.640
Get your Buranki.

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:12.230
That's Epimew's right hand, Caladbolg.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.980
Take it.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.480
I will use it gratefully.

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:26.740
Moses, was it? I swear we'll avenge Laetitia.

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:28.620
Please do.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:35.620
Our Bubuki will never take the 
form of the Buranki Epimew again.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.750
Epimew has ascended to Heaven,

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.250
along with Laetitia-sama.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.710
<i>I'm counting on you, Kaoruko! 
Take care of Reoko-sama!</i>

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:05.960
Give it a rest! Pipe down! Shut up!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:07.410
Ugh, I'm wiped.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:11.120
Seriously, how did Zampaza 
sink all the way down there?

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:16.080
Sorry... I kinda screwed up.

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:19.090
Well, we don't have time! Let's go!

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:31.060
Hey, Epizo, what the heck are those Bubuki?

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.100
They're Laetitia's limbs.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.770
I'm going to use them to destroy Guy.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:40.140
In that case, let me use one, too.

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:44.030
I've got a stupidly huge score to settle with
him that can't be repaid by ordinary means.

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:46.530
Right.
